[/corkami/collisions/blob/master/examples/collision1.png](/corkami/collisions/blob/master/examples/collision1.png) ⟷
[/corkami/collisions/blob/master/examples/collision2.png](/corkami/collisions/blob/master/examples/collision2.png)

